        "abstract": "We report on reliability tests on InP HEMT MMICs by two approaches. First we describe elevated-temperature lifetests on Ka-band LNA MMICs, for studying all thermally-driven degradation mechanisms. Then we describe ramped-voltage studies of separate capacitors, for measuring time-dependent dielectric breakdown (TDDB), which is accelerated mostly by elevated voltage.",
